title: "Noise-Limited Non-Gaussian Photonic Circuits"
abstract: >-
  Simulation and analysis code for locating the boundary at which loss,
  dephasing, circuit depth and non-Gaussian resource placement end the
  operational advantage of a non-Gaussian photonic circuit over a
  resource-matched Gaussian one.
